<title>FRANCE: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF GRAF V COETZER.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF GRAF V COETZER.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of Tuesday's French Open</p>
<p>women's singles quarter-final match between second seed Steffi</p>
<p>Graf of Germany and 11th seed Amanda Coetzer of South Africa</p>
<p>(world ranking in brackets):</p>
<p>Coetzer won 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Time: one hour 32 minutes</p>
<p>					GRAF (2)	 COETZER (11)</p>
<p>    Aces				2		    0</p>
<p>    Double faults		   1		    3</p>
<p>    Percentage first serves    67		   77</p>
<p>    Forehand winners	     12		    3</p>
<p>    Backhand winners		1		    4</p>
<p>    Unforced errors		64		   33</p>
<p>    Break points		    5		   19</p>
<p>    Breaks of serve		 2		    6</p>
</text>
